FindInfraHomotopyRepresentative", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["graph", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["obj", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "87b15cf0-dd2e-41a9-9c2d-590b2776e50a"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives length-shortest walk Graphs in the homotopy class of obj. An open \
walk keeps its endpoints fixed; a cycle keeps its base point fixed. \
\"FreeHomotopy\" -> True frees either.",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"80c51c11-8156-4301-b231-1c34a62ab76c"],

